 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Rettoushoku no Saikyou Kenja - Teihen no \"Murabito\" kara Yoyuu de Sekai Saikyou"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja-ro": "Rettoushoku no Saikyou Kenja - Teihen no \"Murabito\" kara Yoyuu de Sekai Saikyou"
   },
   {
    "ja": "劣等職の最強賢者 ～底辺の【村人】から余裕で世界最強～"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Inferior Grade Strongest Sage ~From the Lowest Villager to the World's Strongest With Ease~"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Who on earth said it was an inferior job?\n\nWho called it the weakest!\n\n[Villager] is the strongest job!!\n\nThe goal is--simply to be \"the strongest\"!!\n\nThe six major magical jobs: [Warrior], [Cleric], [Mage], [Blacksmith], [Seeker], and [Scholar].\n\nBy repeatedly reincarnating, a great sage became the strongest in each of these job magics in the world.\n\nHowever, he realized that there was a limit to his strength with only one magic job per life, and he despaired.\n\nThe great sage had almost given up, but then he discovered that the inferior job [Villager], the only one thought to be unable to use magic, was actually an all-purpose job, and he reincarnated again.\n\nThus, the great sage, reborn as a [Villager], silenced the people who mocked him for being an inferior job, and rose to become the strongest in the world.\n\nAn alternate world battle fantasy about a man who never gives up on strength!",
   "ja": "劣等職などど一体誰が言った。\n最弱などと誰が罵った！\n【村人】は最強の職業だ!!\n\n\n目指すのは――ただひたすらに”最強”!!\n\n六大職業魔法【戦士】【聖職者】【魔導士】【鍛冶師】【探索者】【学者】。\n転生を繰り返すことによって、いずれの職業魔法でも世界最強となった大賢者がいた。\nしかし、一回の人生につき、ひとつの職業魔法では、強さに限界があることを悟り、絶望する。\n諦めかけた大賢者だったが、唯一魔法が使えないと思われていた\n劣等職【村人】が実は万能職であることを発見し、再び転生する。\nかくして【村人】に生まれ変わった大賢者は、劣等職と馬鹿にする人間たちを黙らせ、世界最強へと成り上がる。\n\n飽くなき強さを追い求める男の異世界バトルファンタジー！"
  },
